WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.409
Today your child reads silly sentences, and then a story.

2
00:00:03.859 --> 00:00:10.671
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:11.171 --> 00:00:12.787
These are today's two pages.

4
00:00:13.237 --> 00:00:18.101
Some children guess from what would make sense. So today's sentences do not make sense.

5
00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:23.269
Here is the one rule for today. If a word goes wrong, do not stop your child.

6
00:00:23.719 --> 00:00:28.454
Wait until the end of the sentence. Then say: look again. Touch every letter.

7
00:00:28.904 --> 00:00:32.542
Let your child find it. Finding it is worth more than being told.

8
00:00:32.992 --> 00:00:36.928
For job two, your child reads a sentence, then draws what it says.

9
00:00:37.378 --> 00:00:40.006
The drawing shows you which words were really read.

10
00:00:40.456 --> 00:00:46.882
Then turn to the story. Its pictures are at the bottom, for after the reading. Cover them with the slide card.

11
00:00:47.332 --> 00:00:51.232
Let them read it to you. Then let them read it to someone else in the family.
